Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Aprova sozinho o aviso "programa acessando endereços de e-mail" do Outlook 16 (so este aviso). Leia o LEIAME.txt antes.
[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Policies\Microsoft\Office\16.0\Outlook\Security]
"AdminSecurityMode"=dword:00000003
"PromptOOMAddressInformationAccess"=dword:00000001
